### Test tay bang VS Code extension "REST Client" (bam "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
# @base = https://smart-parking-api.onrender.com/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Dang ky
# @name reg
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "an@test.vn", "password": "123456", "fullName": "Nguyen Van An", "phone": "0901234567" }

### Dang nhap
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "an@test.vn", "password": "123456" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Toi la ai
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Them xe
POST {{base}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plateNumber": "51A-123.45", "brand": "Toyota", "color": "Trang" }

### Danh sach bai do
GET {{base}}/lots

### Chi tiet bai
GET {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01

### Dat cho o 2 trong 15 phut
# @name resv
POST {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slotNumber": 2, "minutes": 15 }

### Gia han 10 phut
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{resv.response.body.id}}/extend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 10 }

### Huy dat cho
DELETE {{base}}/reservations/{{resv.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lich su dat cho cua toi
GET {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ADMIN =====
# @name admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@smartparking.vn", "password": "MAT_KHAU_ADMIN" }

###
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Mo barie vao
POST {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/gates/entry/open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Thong ke hom nay
GET {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Luot do
GET {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Nhat ky su kien
GET {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/events?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===== THANH TOAN / GIAO DICH =====
### Luot do cua toi (parking / unpaid / paid)
GET {{base}}/sessions/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thanh toan luot do da ket thuc (doi 1 thanh id lay tu /sessions/mine)
POST {{base}}/sessions/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "momo" }

### Lich su giao dich cua toi
GET {{base}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: thu tien mat tai cong (khach vang lai)
POST {{base}}/lots/sp-demo-01/sessions/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "cash" }
